{"version":1,"key":"card:533","content":{"id":533,"content":[{"type":"paragraph","disableDrag":false,"children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"职业生涯的三个阶段："}]},{"type":"bulleted-list","children":[{"type":"list-item","children":[{"type":"paragraph","disableDrag":false,"children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"融入期"}]},{"type":"bulleted-list","children":[{"type":"list-item","children":[{"type":"paragraph","disableDrag":false,"children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"找准自己的角色定位，成为不规则但是很契合的齿轮"}]}]},{"type":"list-item","children":[{"type":"paragraph","disableDrag":false,"children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"建立信任是重中之重"}]}]}]}]},{"type":"list-item","children":[{"type":"paragraph","disableDrag":false,"children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"突破期"}]},{"type":"bulleted-list","children":[{"type":"list-item","children":[{"type":"paragraph","disableDrag":false,"children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"主动是能否突破的决定性因素，主动寻求机会，解决问题做到 120%，提出别人想不到的方法，做到别人做不到的事情，而不是简单的执行"}]}]},{"type":"list-item","children":[{"type":"paragraph","disableDrag":false,"children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"制定长期目标，包括业务目标和个人目标"}]},{"type":"bulleted-list","children":[{"type":"list-item","children":[{"type":"paragraph","disableDrag":false,"children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"业务长期目标是解决实际的业务问题，应当与公司的战略目标保持一致"}]}]},{"type":"list-item","children":[{"type":"paragraph","disableDrag":false,"children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"个人层面，制定长期职业发展目标，规划职业发展路径"}]}]}]}]},{"type":"list-item","children":[{"type":"paragraph","disableDrag":false,"children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"寻找标杆，标杆不是某个人，而是某种特质或行为"}]},{"type":"bulleted-list","children":[{"type":"list-item","children":[{"type":"paragraph","disableDrag":false,"children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"有人文档整理做的非常好"}]}]},{"type":"list-item","children":[{"type":"paragraph","disableDrag":false,"children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"有人沟通过程如鱼得水"}]}]},{"type":"list-item","children":[{"type":"paragraph","disableDrag":false,"children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"有人每日记录问题，定期复盘"}]}]},{"type":"list-item","children":[{"type":"paragraph","disableDrag":false,"children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"... ..."}]}]}]},{"type":"paragraph","disableDrag":false,"children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"观察到这些优秀特质时，深入分析内在处事逻辑，为我所用"}]}]}]}]},{"type":"list-item","children":[{"type":"paragraph","disableDrag":false,"children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"成熟期"}]},{"type":"bulleted-list","children":[{"type":"list-item","children":[{"type":"paragraph","disableDrag":false,"children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"持续学习，专业力是立身之本，失去专业力就失去了判断力和决策力"}]}]},{"type":"list-item","children":[{"type":"paragraph","disableDrag":false,"children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"寻找除升职加薪外的正反馈，这是坚持这份事业的持久动力，比如为他人解决问题，分享技术和经验"}]}]},{"type":"list-item","children":[{"type":"paragraph","disableDrag":false,"children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"充分利用组织资源，避免个人英雄主义"}]}]}]}]}]},{"type":"paragraph","disableDrag":false,"children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"需要掌握的元能力："}]},{"type":"bulleted-list","children":[{"type":"list-item","children":[{"type":"paragraph","disableDrag":false,"children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"纠偏力"}]},{"type":"bulleted-list","children":[{"type":"list-item","children":[{"type":"paragraph","disableDrag":false,"children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"认知，将外部输入的信息转化为判断和决策的思维方式，提高认知就是基于信息做出正确判断和决策的训练过程，多观察、多思考、多实践"}]}]},{"type":"list-item","children":[{"type":"paragraph","disableDrag":false,"children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"反省，定期停下来审视自己的行为和决策，同时观察他人如何做事，时常回头看看，避免脱轨很久而不自知"}]}]},{"type":"list-item","children":[{"type":"paragraph","disableDrag":false,"children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"勇气，勇于走出舒适区，偏是由于惯性，由于沿着舒适区前行，而偏离正轨，必须勇于克服舒适带来的惰性"}]}]}]}]},{"type":"list-item","children":[{"type":"paragraph","disableDrag":false,"children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"换位思考，在对方的立场思考，可以得到更完备的答案"}]},{"type":"bulleted-list","children":[{"type":"list-item","children":[{"type":"paragraph","disableDrag":false,"children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"发生矛盾，如果我是 ta，我会怎么做，为什么这么做"}]}]},{"type":"list-item","children":[{"type":"paragraph","disableDrag":false,"children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"汇报演讲：如果我是 ta，我想听什么样的内容"}]}]},{"type":"list-item","children":[{"type":"paragraph","disableDrag":false,"children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"沟通协作，如果我是 ta，采取我的方案有什么样的利和弊"}]}]},{"type":"list-item","children":[{"type":"paragraph","disableDrag":false,"children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"写代码，如果我是 reviewer，我希望看到什么样的代码"}]}]}]}]},{"type":"list-item","children":[{"type":"paragraph","disableDrag":false,"children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"短时间把问题描述清楚的能力，决定了能否抓住机会，并确保我们的想法能够被准确的理解和接纳"}]},{"type":"paragraph","disableDrag":false,"children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"使用 STAR（Situation、Task、Action、Result） 法则， 在什么样的场景下需要完成什么任务，采取了什么样的行动，拿到了什么样的结果。A 和 R 体现了我们的价值，S 和 T 往往被忽略，但是 S 和 T 是吸引听众注意力的关键"}]}]},{"type":"list-item","children":[{"type":"paragraph","disableDrag":false,"children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"敢拼、敢当"}]},{"type":"bulleted-list","children":[{"type":"list-item","children":[{"type":"paragraph","disableDrag":false,"children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"拼搏，拼搏不仅仅是单纯的贡献，而是个人成长和职业发展中的宝贵机会"}]}]},{"type":"list-item","children":[{"type":"paragraph","disableDrag":false,"children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"担当，"},{"type":"underline","color":"red","lineType":"solid","colorSelectOpen":false,"children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"担当是信任的基础，信任是一切的基础"}]},{"type":"formatted","text":"，“遇事能上，出事能抗”是职场人最基本的要求"}]}]}]}]}]},{"type":"paragraph","disableDrag":false,"children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"职场建议："}]},{"type":"bulleted-list","children":[{"type":"list-item","children":[{"type":"paragraph","disableDrag":false,"children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"对事"}]},{"type":"bulleted-list","children":[{"type":"list-item","children":[{"type":"paragraph","disableDrag":false,"children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"找到团队里缺失的人和能力，这是一条捷径"}]}]},{"type":"list-item","children":[{"type":"paragraph","disableDrag":false,"children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"在精力足够的情况下，和工作沾边的事情都值得去了解下"}]}]},{"type":"list-item","children":[{"type":"paragraph","disableDrag":false,"children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"减少信息不对称，人与人之间的差异大多数来自于信息不对称，建立广泛的人脉网络、持续学习、保持对行业的高度敏感"}]}]},{"type":"list-item","children":[{"type":"paragraph","disableDrag":false,"children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"把工作和生活分开，不要把工作中的负面情绪带到生活中，这样会反过来影响个人的幸福感和效率"}]}]}]}]},{"type":"list-item","children":[{"type":"paragraph","disableDrag":false,"children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"对人"}]},{"type":"bulleted-list","children":[{"type":"list-item","children":[{"type":"paragraph","disableDrag":false,"children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"第一印象非常重要，上级和同事对你的画像在很长一段时间都定格在第一印象，后续纠偏需要花费 5 倍甚至 10 倍的努力"}]}]},{"type":"list-item","children":[{"type":"paragraph","disableDrag":false,"children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"觉得遇到不好的人，换位思考，如果是因为立场做出让你不舒服的事情，不用纠结"}]}]},{"type":"list-item","children":[{"type":"paragraph","disableDrag":false,"children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"不用怕得罪他人，由于思维方式和职能不同，冲突在所难免，先礼后兵，需要明确表达立场，温和的表达，如果不行，该辩论就辩论"}]}]},{"type":"list-item","children":[{"type":"paragraph","disableDrag":false,"children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"像对手学习而不是像朋友学习，因为朋友都是和我们相似的人。对手不是敌对的人，而是有着不同观点、不同做事背景、不同经验的人，这样可以获得新的视角和方法，打破思维定式"}]}]},{"type":"list-item","children":[{"type":"paragraph","disableDrag":false,"children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"要充分给出组织/上级给你分配资源的理由。在日常工作中适当的展示自己的能力，为他人解决问题来证明自己对团队的价值，"},{"type":"underline","color":"red","lineType":"solid","colorSelectOpen":false,"children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"最令人满足的不是得到了好绩效，而是其他人都认为应该获得好绩效"}]},{"text":"","type":"formatted"}]}]}]}]},{"type":"list-item","children":[{"type":"paragraph","disableDrag":false,"children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"对己"}]},{"type":"bulleted-list","children":[{"type":"list-item","children":[{"type":"paragraph","disableDrag":false,"children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"先斩后奏。在不过分超出能力的情况下，先做出承诺，再逼自己改进这件事情。"},{"type":"formatted","text":"即使一开始感到不安，也不要轻易拒绝新的机会","bold":true,"color":"#e33a32","darkColor":"#fa7873"}]}]},{"type":"list-item","children":[{"type":"paragraph","disableDrag":false,"children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"尽量保持边界感，对于职责之外的任务被推给你，客观判断是否属于你的职责范围，如果不属于，需要找到合适的人来承担这项工作，在这个过程中确保工作承接顺利，直到有专业的人接手"}]}]},{"type":"list-item","children":[{"type":"paragraph","disableDrag":false,"children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"如果对环境不满意，改变自己适应环境"}]}]},{"type":"list-item","children":[{"type":"paragraph","disableDrag":false,"children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"避免完美主义陷阱，把事情做到尽善尽美，在多数情况下是好事，但是有个缺点，很难接受负面评价，很多时候会把忠告认为是挑刺，给人留下刚愎自用的印象，要接受自己的不完美，这样在面对不如意时才能保持理智和判断力"}]}]}]}]},{"type":"list-item","children":[{"type":"paragraph","disableDrag":false,"children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"口碑"}]},{"type":"bulleted-list","children":[{"type":"list-item","children":[{"type":"paragraph","disableDrag":false,"children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"能面对面了解我们的人最多只有两位数，其他人对我们的了解都来自于口碑。打造好口碑很重要，但是靠的是真诚和专业，而不是伪装和表演"}]}]},{"type":"list-item","children":[{"type":"paragraph","disableDrag":false,"children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"不可能让所有人满意，但对事不对人，同时避免背后议论他人"}]}]},{"type":"list-item","children":[{"type":"paragraph","disableDrag":false,"children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"避免零和博弈，追求双赢，并且最多只占 49%。扩大蛋糕，而不是争夺已有资源，长期来看，不要成为总占便宜的人，否则最终会影响团队的信任和合作意愿"}]}]},{"type":"list-item","children":[{"type":"paragraph","disableDrag":false,"children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"来自没有利益关系的合作伙伴的肯定更有说服力"}]}]}]}]}]},{"type":"paragraph","disableDrag":false,"children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"参考："},{"type":"link","url":"https://juejin.cn/post/7425497083753529378","openEdit":false,"children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"90后程序员的职业成长漫谈"}]},{"text":"","type":"formatted"}]}],"tags":["职场"],"createTime":1743323780536,"updateTime":1761990861310,"linkedCards":[]},"meta":{"type":"card","publishTime":1761990861310}}